"k" = (/obj/structure/table/wood,/obj/item/weapon/hammer,/obj/item/weapon/wrench,/obj/item/weapon/paper{name = "smithy guide"; info = "<b>Smithy</b><br>1. Feed the bloomery wood, coal or charcoal, add iron ore, then use an empty hand on it to light it.<br>2. Work sponge or pig iron on the anvil to refine it into iron.<br>3. Use iron on the anvil to forge tools, weapons and parts. The anvil needs a Crafting coefficient of 1.70 or more: see IC > Skill Progress. On most maps outside Nomads only blacksmith jobs may use it.<br>4. Sharpen blades at the grindstone and mend armor at the repair workbench.<br>Careful: a hammer on help intent dismantles the bloomery."},/turf/floor/plating/cobblestone)
